---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Bhagyashri Patil | Product Strategy, Solutions Engineering & AI">
<section class="hero">
 <div class="hero-copy">
  <span class="eyebrow">Product Thinking &nbsp; / &nbsp; Solutions Engineering &nbsp; / &nbsp; Applied AI</span>
  <h1><span class="intro">Hi, I'm Bhagyashri.</span>I turn complex problems into <em>products that create value.</em></h1>
  <p>I bring a strong foundation in data and enterprise solutions to product-oriented problem solving. My approach combines stakeholder discovery, practical architecture, thoughtful trade-offs, and measurable outcomes.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">Explore selected work ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/experience/">How I work →</a></div>
  <div class="availability"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Exploring opportunities in Boston, MA &amp; remote</div>
 </div>
 <div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of product strategy, solution design and measurable outcomes">
  <div class="halo"></div>
  <div class="visual">
   <div class="visual-header"><span class="dots">● ● ●</span><span>PRODUCT / SYSTEMS / IMPACT</span></div>
   <h3>From opportunity to outcome</h3>
   <div class="steps"><div><small>01 / Discover</small><strong>Customer problem</strong></div><div><small>02 / Design</small><strong>Solution approach</strong></div><div><small>03 / Deliver</small><strong>Business value</strong></div></div>
   <div class="visual-foot"><span>PRODUCT</span><span>ENGINEERING</span><span>AI-READY</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="float-tag">✦ Product-minded by design</div>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Perspective</span><div><h2>Lead with the problem.<br/>Design for the outcome.</h2><p>I see product decisions and technical decisions as two sides of the same challenge. Understanding users, clarifying requirements, choosing trade-offs, and building scalable foundations all contribute to products that work in the real world.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Capabilities</span><div><h2>One connected skill set. Multiple industries.</h2><p>My strengths translate across technology, financial services, banking, real estate, and other organizations building data-intensive and AI-enabled products.</p></div></div>
<div class="cards">
 <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Product</span><h3>Product strategy &amp; delivery</h3><p>Framing problems, aligning stakeholders, defining success measures, prioritizing needs, and iterating toward useful outcomes.</p></article>
 <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Engineering</span><h3>Solutions engineering &amp; architecture</h3><p>Translating requirements into technical approaches, connecting systems and data, and evaluating feasibility, scalability, and trade-offs.</p></article>
 <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Intelligence</span><h3>Data products &amp; applied AI</h3><p>Building on enterprise analytics, data modeling, automation, and machine learning while exploring practical AI-enabled workflows.</p></article>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Selected work</span><div><h2>Proof through projects.</h2><p>Case studies connect the business context, product questions, solution approach, and technical decisions. More product, cloud, and AI projects will be added as they're ready to share.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">View case studies ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/research/">Research &amp; exploration →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">04 / Connect</span><div><h2>Building what's next.</h2><p>I'm particularly interested in product and solutions-focused opportunities in the Boston area or remote, across industries where technology can solve meaningful business problems.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bhagyashripatil/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Let's connect on LinkedIn ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/patilbp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.13fr) minmax(335px,.87fr);gap:clamp(35px,5vw,90px);align-items:start;min-height:unset;padding:var(--page-intro-top) 0 var(--page-intro-bottom)}.hero-copy{min-width:0;max-width:850px}.hero-art{align-self:center}.hero h1{max-width:800px}.intro{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,1.7vw,1.85rem);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:15px}h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#4266da}.hero p{max-width:690px}.availability{margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#51637e;font-size:.89rem;font-weight:650}.status-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#4da98b;display:inline-block;flex:none}.hero-art{position:relative;min-height:420px;display:grid;place-items:center}.halo{position:absolute;width:min(97%,500px);aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:40%;transform:rotate(-12deg);background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,#d9e4ff,transparent 63%),linear-gradient(130deg,#f0f4ff,#e7ecfb)}.visual{position:relative;width:min(92%,490px);border:1px solid #dfe6f3;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(25px,3vw,38px);background:white;box-shadow:0 30px 75px #263a6621;transform:rotate(2deg)}.visual-header{border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf6;padding-bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8795a9;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;gap:12px}.dots{color:#b9c8e1;letter-spacing:.15em}.visual h3{margin:22px 0;font-size:1.18rem}.steps{display:grid;gap:11px}.steps>div{background:#f5f7fc;border:1px solid #e5eaf5;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px}.steps small{display:block;color:#6980b9;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:800;font-size:.72rem}.steps strong{color:#243855;font-size:.95rem}.visual-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:18px;color:#8a96aa;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800}.float-tag{position:absolute;bottom:3%;left:0;background:white;padding:13px 17px;border:1px solid #e3e9f3;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 14px 30px #263a6619;font-size:.83rem;font-weight:800;color:#4167ba}
@media(max-width:1120px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:unset;gap:10px}.hero-art{max-width:580px;width:100%;margin:auto}}@media(max-width:600px){.hero{padding:var(--page-intro-top) 0 var(--page-intro-bottom)}.hero-art{min-height:325px}.visual{padding:20px}.float-tag{bottom:0}}
</style>
